NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/config.Config#DeathConsolidateEvery kind=field
  digest=b3:2d0e5075881040403c885773ce4d556ed0a372cc29f057fe44ba6e8312edc581 file=neo/internal/config/config.go range=150:156 lang=go exported=true byte_range=8993:9438
  sig=int
  doc=DeathConsolidateEvery is the bounded cadence for the self-authoring\nconsolidation pass (self-model task 3.2, req.5.2): after this many recorded\nloop deaths, the agent reads its death journal and writes/reinforces durable\nhow-I-fail failure-pattern memories, deduplicating recurrences of the same\nmode into ONE reinforced belief. It runs on this cadence, NEVER every turn;\n<= 0 disables the pass.
